    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions\n\n- Generic **Webhook** POST `telegram`; payload uses `message.text` at the root or under `body` (Telegram update shape).\n- **Start Command** IF: `/start` gets a fixed greeting via **Send Telegram Reply** without OpenAI; other text goes to OpenAI.\n- Inbound auth: **httpHeaderAuth** credential named **Telegram API** (maps to Telegram `secret_token` header); outbound send uses **telegramApi** with the same display name.\n- OpenAI: **gpt-4o-mini**, user message only, maxTokens 500; **3 retries**, **5s** between tries.\n- **chatId**: `message.chat.id`, fallbacks, then **$env.TELEGRAM_REPLY_CHAT_ID** for minimal test payloads.\n- Errors: **onError → Call Error Handling Workflow** with workflow id **tg-ai-chatbot-error** (defined outside this ticket); only `stage` and `errorMessage` are passed (no message bodies or tokens).\n- Non-text updates end at **Ignore Non-Text** without error."
      },
      "id": "f2a3b4c5-6d7e-8f9a-3b4c-5d6e7f8091a2",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
